# Normalize line endings: LF in the repository AND in the working tree, on every platform.
# Added 2026-09-04: the Budgeting design-system drift check (Budgeting/CLAUDE.md) is byte-exact,
# and mixed CRLF/LF checkouts on Windows made identical files read as DRIFT. eol=lf overrides
# core.autocrlf, so fresh checkouts are LF everywhere and the check stays trustworthy.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows-native scripts genuinely need CRLF.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Explicit binaries (text=auto detects these anyway; declared for clarity).
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
